prompt.output_format:
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No explanation. No markdown. No extra text. Exactly these 5 keys:
{ "step_therapy_text": "...", "num_steps_brands": "...", "num_steps_generic": "...", "step_phototherapy": "...", "_reasoning": "One sentence: which specific rule/path drove your decision (e.g., 'Rule 3: severity bypass at option 3 yields NA for generic; no biologic prerequisite'). Mention the specific text that triggered each NA." }
Return ONLY a valid JSON object. Do NOT wrap in markdown code blocks. Do NOT use backticks. Do NOT prefix with ```json. Your entire response must start with { and end with }.

